CinnabarIsland_Text_DoorIsLocked::
    .string "The door is locked…$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_BlaineLivedHereSinceBeforeLab::
    .string "CHRONDROLIA GYM's EDDIE is quite the\n"
    .string "odd fellow.\p"
    .string "He's lived on the island since way\n"
    .string "before the LAB was built.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_ScientistsExperimentInMansion::
    .string "That big building is the PLANT.\p"
    .string "They say it was a burned mansion\n"
    .string "long ago. Now it runs on heat.\p"
    .string "Volcano heat. Free power, forever.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_IslandSign::
    .string "CHRONDROLIA\n"
    .string "The Yellow City of Topaz$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_PokemonLab::
    .string "POKéMON LAB$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_GymSign::
    .string "CHRONDROLIA POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: EDDIE\l"
    .string "The Hotheaded Quiz Master!$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_HeyIfItIsntPlayer::
    .string "Huh?\n"
    .string "Hey, if it isn't {PLAYER}!$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_ComeWithMeToOneIsland::
    .string "Look, it's me, BILL.\n"
    .string "Long time no see!\p"
    .string "I hope you're still using my\n"
    .string "PC system.\p"
    .string "Well, listen, since we met up here,\n"
    .string "how about spending time with me?\p"
    .string "There's this little island in the far\n"
    .string "south called ONE ISLAND.\p"
    .string "A friend invited me, so I'm on my\n"
    .string "way out there.\p"
    .string "How about it?\n"
    .string "Do you feel like coming with me?$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_AllRightLetsGo::
    .string "All right, then.\n"
    .string "Let's go!$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_IllBeWaitingInPokeCenter::
    .string "What, are you too busy?\p"
    .string "Well, all right.\n"
    .string "The boat hasn't arrived yet anyway.\p"
    .string "I'll be waiting at the POKéMON\n"
    .string "CENTER over there.\p"
    .string "Come see me when you're done with\n"
    .string "your business here.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_MyPalsBoatArrived::
    .string "Looks like my pal's boat arrived,\n"
    .string "too.\p"
    .string "He sent it specially here to\n"
    .string "CHRONDROLIA to pick me up.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_IfYouHaveTriPassYouCanGoAgain::
    .string "Hey, wasn't that a long cruise?\p"
    .string "My buddy CELIO seemed to enjoy\n"
    .string "your company.\p"
    .string "I'm sure he'd welcome you if you\n"
    .string "were to visit him again.\p"
    .string "If you have a TRI-PASS, you can\n"
    .string "always take a ferry there from\l"
    .string "APATIA PORT.\p"
    .string "All right, thanks for your company!$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_PlantWorker::
    .string "WORKER: Ever wonder why the PLANT\n"
    .string "stands on this island?\p"
    .string "The SEAFOAM volcano sleeps right\n"
    .string "under the sea. All that heat boils\p"
    .string "our water into steam. The steam\n"
    .string "spins the turbines. Free power!\p"
    .string "Half the lights in KANTO come\n"
    .string "from this rock.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_Mayor::
    .string "MAYOR: Welcome to CHRONDROLIA!\p"
    .string "Thieves? Stones? We heard the\n"
    .string "rumors. None of it came here.\p"
    .string "There is no precious stone on this\n"
    .string "island. The TOPAZ is only a name.\p"
    .string "Relax, trainer. Visit the GYM,\n"
    .string "enjoy the lights.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_Scientist::
    .string "SCIENTIST: Ten years ago the AURA\n"
    .string "changed every POKéMON's type.\p"
    .string "Not our grid. Not our island.\n"
    .string "The volcano keeps it stable.\p"
    .string "Everything is safe here. Really.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_LittleGirl::
    .string "Grandma says the stone of this\n"
    .string "town is only a fairy tale.\p"
    .string "But the big pylon hums at night.\n"
    .string "I like it!$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_LightsOut::
    .string "Every light in CHRONDROLIA just\n"
    .string "died at once.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_MayorReveal1::
    .string "MAYOR: A fine badge, trainer. And\n"
    .string "the SECRET KEY. Well done.\p"
    .string "ONYBRIS needed one honest hand to\n"
    .string "open the old vault under the PLANT.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_MayorReveal2::
    .string "The TOPAZ sleeps in the transformer\n"
    .string "park. Its heat feeds the volcano.\p"
    .string "SELENE is already there. And the\n"
    .string "PLANT is ours. All of it.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_MayorReveal3::
    .string "Do not take it personally. The\n"
    .string "MASTER pays far better than the\p"
    .string "council. Now, excuse me. I have a\n"
    .string "lot of lights to switch on… later.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_PlantWorkerDone::
    .string "WORKER: Those 'workers' were\n"
    .string "ONYBRIS for weeks!\p"
    .string "The grid is ours again. And the\n"
    .string "lights are back on. Thanks, kid!$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_ScientistDone::
    .string "SCIENTIST: The cadre said the\n"
    .string "eruption was their doing.\p"
    .string "The coast guard lifted the sea\n"
    .string "road ban. Be careful out there.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_LittleGirlDone::
    .string "The pylon hums happy again!\n"
    .string "Thank you!$"
